<title>USA: Synaptx Worldwide acquires Oraycom.</title>
<headline>Synaptx Worldwide acquires Oraycom.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synaptx Worldwide Inc said Thursday it had acquired Oraycom Inc, a sales representative company serving the private network, public telephone network and cable companies.</p>
<p>Synaptx said it expects Oraycom to add $1 million to revenues in its fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>The purchase was completed with a combination of cash and stock. Specific terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Synaptx is a telecommunications and information company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
